# The local model files live here.
#
# They are never committed: a GGUF is 686 MB and the OCR graph is 450 MB.
# A clinic copies the files it needs to the PC that runs the import, and the
# setup panel picks them from here (or from anywhere else on the PC).
#
# The text model:
#   MiniCPM5-1B-SFT.Q4_K_M.gguf
# The OCR model and its support files (Phase 2, still dark):
#   falcon_ocr_kv_token_q8.onnx
#   falcon-ocr/tokenizer.json
#   falcon-ocr/tokenizer_config.json
#   falcon-ocr/special_tokens_map.json
#   falcon-ocr/config.json
#
# The dev server serves this folder with Range support, so a big file can be
# read in parts.
